OL,3,GNEWSANature walks 'another tool' in    
OL,4,Amental health fight                    
OL,6,FPeople struggling with their mental    
OL,7,Fhealth are being encouraged to connect 
OL,8,Fwith nature on their doorstep.         
OL,10,FHope Haven, in Whitehaven, west        
OL,11,FCumbria, opened in March as one of six 
OL,12,Fpilot centres across the country       
OL,13,Fdedicated to tackling problems before  
OL,14,Fthey escalate.                         
OL,16,FIt has now joined forces with the RSPB 
OL,17,Fto issue "nature prescriptions", which 
OL,18,Fsee people encouraged to visit a number
OL,19,Fof places in the area, such as the     
OL,20,Flocal harbour, sand dunes at Ravenglass
OL,21,Fand Walkmill Community Woodland at     
OL,22,FMoresby.                               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
