OL,3,GNEWSANature walks 'another tool' in    
OL,4,Amental health fight                    
OL,6,FClinical manager Barbara Slater said   
OL,7,Fthe scheme was "another tool" to add to
OL,8,Fthe hub's range of interventions.      
